{
  "_note": "单服务(22 · 158×158):一个服务此刻怎么样 —— 大字状态 + 进行中事故标题 + 已持续多久;没有进行中事故时补近 7 天方格。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FAF8FE\\,#F4F0FE)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#19191F\\,#1E1B28)@90",
        "id": "bg"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{brand.y}+({brand.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#7A4FD8|#B49BFF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "id": "srcdot",
        "_note": "源色身份点(本包紫,刻意避开五档状态色)。y 锚在标题的实测框上,不写常量。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-83pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${k0n},${@i18n.brand})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "brand",
        "_note": "服务名;取不到数据时回落本包名,一眼还认得出这是什么组件。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-58pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "46pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "id": "at",
        "_note": "时间锚 = 这次检查的时刻(取数那一刻)。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),-9),${@i18n.lv0},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),0),${@i18n.lv0},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),1),${@i18n.lv1},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),2),${@i18n.lv2},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),3),${@i18n.lv3},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),4),${@i18n.lv4},${@i18n.lvU}))))))]",
        "fontSize": "21pt",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),2),#A86E00|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
        "maxLines": "2",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "st",
        "lineSpacing": "1pt",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),-9),1,0)]",
        "_note": "大字状态,颜色随档位;文字本身就是结论,色盲也读得出。取不到数据时这支藏起(hide=1 仍占位),文字换成「运行正常」只为撑出与有数时同样的 {st.b},下面的说明行不上窜;画出来的是下一支 `--`,不是「运行正常」。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "39.75pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "--",
        "fontSize": "21pt",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),2),#A86E00|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "stE",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),-9),0,1)]",
        "_note": "空值「--」支(2026-09-25 第二轮):txt 盒顶 = 墨迹顶,与结论词同 y 的「--」会被顶到结论位最上沿、贴着服务名。y 下移 7.75pt = 21pt 结论词墨迹中线 − 短横半厚(rcnrender 实测),短横落在结论词中线上。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{st.b}+5pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${k0t},)]",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "3",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "ttl",
        "lineSpacing": "2pt",
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0o},0),0),0,2)]",
        "_note": "进行中事故的标题(服务商原文,英文)。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{st.b}+5pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),1),${@i18n.dMaint},if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),2),${@i18n.dDeg},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),-9),${@i18n.dUnk},${@i18n.dOk})))]",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "2",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "desc",
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0o},0),0),2,0)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0o},0),0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "122pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "24pt",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(${k0sc},1),${@i18n.stInv},if::(eq::(${k0sc},2),${@i18n.stIdf},if::(eq::(${k0sc},3),${@i18n.stMon},${@i18n.stUpd})))]${@i18n.durPre}${k0A}$[if::(eq::(${k0f},1),${@i18n.uMinE},if::(eq::(${k0f},2),${@i18n.uHM},${@i18n.uDM}))]$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0B},0),0),,${k0B})]$[if::(and::(eq::(${k0f},2),ne::(findNotEmpty::(${k0B},0),0)),${@i18n.uMinE},if::(and::(eq::(${k0f},3),ne::(findNotEmpty::(${k0B},0),0)),${@i18n.uHE},))]",
            "fontSize": "9.5pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "alignmentV": "1",
            "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "8pt",
              "leftB": "8pt",
              "rightT": "8pt",
              "rightB": "8pt"
            },
            "paddingLeft": "22pt",
            "paddingRight": "8pt"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "底部状态条 = 一个 txt(自带底板 / 圆角 / 内边距)。两个分支覆盖全部数据形态(含取数失败),这块形状恒在。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0o},0),0),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "122pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "24pt",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),-9),--,if::(lt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),0),${@i18n.dUnk},${@i18n.dNoInc}))]",
            "fontSize": "9.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "alignmentV": "1",
            "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "8pt",
              "leftB": "8pt",
              "rightT": "8pt",
              "rightB": "8pt"
            },
            "paddingLeft": "22pt",
            "paddingRight": "8pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "130pt",
        "w": "8pt",
        "h": "8pt",
        "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),2),#E0A100|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${k0l},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "4pt",
          "leftB": "4pt",
          "rightT": "4pt",
          "rightB": "4pt"
        },
        "id": "cdot"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${k0o},0),0),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_6},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_6},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_6},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "24.5pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_5},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_5},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_5},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "37.0pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_4},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_4},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_4},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "49.5pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_3},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_3},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_3},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "62.0pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_2},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_2},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_2},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "74.5pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_1},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_1},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_1},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "87.0pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "10pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(eq::(${w0_0},4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,if::(eq::(${w0_0},3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(${w0_0},2),#E0A100|#E8B339,#E7E9EE|#20232A))),#EEF0F3|#1B1D22)]",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}-58pt",
            "y": "100pt",
            "w": "46pt",
            "h": "12pt",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok0},0),1),if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${c0},0),0),${@i18n.wPre}${c0}${@i18n.wSuf},${@i18n.wNone}),--)]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "alignmentV": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "近 7 天方格:左旧右新(最右 = 今天);右侧 = 7 天事故数。取不到历史 = 淡灰格 +「--」。"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "lv0": "运行正常",
        "lv1": "维护中",
        "lv2": "轻微异常",
        "lv3": "部分中断",
        "lv4": "重大中断",
        "lvU": "状态未知",
        "stInv": "调查中",
        "stIdf": "已定位",
        "stMon": "观察中",
        "stUpd": "处理中",
        "uMinE": " 分钟",
        "uHM": " 小时 ",
        "uDM": " 天 ",
        "uHE": " 小时",
        "brand": "服务状态",
        "wPre": "7 天 ",
        "wSuf": " 起",
        "wNone": "7 天无事故",
        "durPre": " · 持续 ",
        "dOk": "所有系统运行正常",
        "dMaint": "计划维护进行中",
        "dDeg": "部分功能受影响",
        "dUnk": "暂时取不到状态",
        "dNoInc": "没有进行中的事故"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "lv0": "Operational",
        "lv1": "Maintenance",
        "lv2": "Minor issues",
